    - df1: second table (base table to be augmented), a pandas.DataFrame-like object
    - var0: name of the shared key column (string)
    - lst0: list of column names (strings) from df0 to bring into df1

    Behavior
    - Ensures var0 is present in both tables.
    - Ensures columns in lst0 exist in df0.
    - Keeps all rows of df1 and brings in matching values from df0 (left join of df1 with df0 on var0).
    - If var0 is not included in lst0, it will still be used for joining but only included once in the result.
    """
